# MIS SARL — Partial Customer PO Acceptance, Partial Deliveries, Invoices & Delivery Notes

Act as a senior full-stack engineer and software architect. You are working on the existing MIS SARL business management application.

Your task is to implement a reliable, simple and professional workflow for:

1. Partial acceptance of quotation items through a customer's Purchase Order (PO).
2. Partial deliveries against the same PO over multiple delivery batches.
3. Automatic creation of one invoice and one delivery note for each delivery batch.
4. Professional PDF generation for both documents, reusing the existing MIS SARL quotation PDF template.

This is an enhancement of the existing application, NOT a complete rewrite.

